{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝陳豪、雲浩影、樂隊太極雷有輝與鄧建明等，今日（22日）現身沙田馬場出席活動。</p><p>陳豪主演劇集《玫瑰戰爭》正在熱播中，甫到場即被記者大喊角色名字「生哥」，他直言目前走在街上也會聽到途人這樣的稱呼：「都幾開心，證明劇集有人追睇。</p><p>（羅嘉良大讚你演</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:03:52.513673+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:54:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.258371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:17.258371+00:00","content_hash":"46fc72a144a93b6e769cd3a4710ffbcbc3b2ac97075ceba8cc38fcc0560e1e6b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}